/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/050.md:7:> - 对象类：标记单元格/marker_cell, 邻域模板/neighborhood_template, 格网/lattice, 多色精灵体/multicolor_sprite, 源锚点/source_anchor_marker, 目标锚点/target_anchor_marker, 分隔网格/separator_grid, 少数单元/minority_cell, 多数单元/majority_cell, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 三角楔形区域/triangular_wedge, 连通分量/connected_component, 孤立像素/isolated_pixel, 四象限/four_quadrants, 控制区域/control_region, 模板瓦片/stencil_tile, 标记环/marker_ring, 引导线/guide_line, 框架/frame, 占位符/placeholder, 精灵体/sprite, 颜色图例/color_legend, 掩码/mask, 占位像素/placeholder_pixel, 控制像素/control_pixel, 前景对象/foreground_object, 中心间隙/center_gap, 分隔行/separator_row, 前景掩码/foreground_mask, 全宽条纹/full_width_stripe, 方形网格/square_grid, 格子单元/lattice_cell, 网格线/lattice_line, 正交路径/orthogonal_path, 同心方环/concentric_ring, 分隔十字/separator_cross, 象限/quadrant
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/050.md:9:> - 条件/判断类：示例邻域传递同色/exemplar_copied_to_same_color, 少数图案为蓝图/minority_pattern_as_blueprint, 标记定义楔形范围/marker_define_wedge, 多像素涂色留单/multi_recolor_single, 像素数决定尺寸/pixel_count_sets_size, 双层图案叠加/two_level_pattern, 交叉点印章环形/stamp_ring_at_cross, 编码映射/encoding_map, 配对色映射/paired_color_mapping, 行首色决定填色/row_key_color, 最大外扩余内缩/max_grow_rest_shrink, 并集合并/union_merge, 位移等于面积/shift_equals_area, 整体旋转/whole_grid_rotate, 双色交叉混合色/intersect_blend_color, 先横后纵路由/horizontal_then_vertical, 切比雪夫距离/chebyshev_distance, 中心对齐/center_aligned, 标记侧翻转且变色/mirror_toward_marker_recolor, 标记所在象限保留/marker_quadrant_retained, 裁剪区背景替换/background_within_crop_replaced
