/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/8/019.md:7:> - 对象类：模板对象/template_object, 连通分量/connected_component, 分隔网格/separator_grid, 模板图块/template_tile, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 前景对象/foreground_object, 基本图元/primitive_shape, 块阵列/block_array, 网格沟槽/lattice_gutter, 边界框/bounding_box, 控制条/control_bar, 递增递减游程/rise_fall_run, 角标记像素/corner_marker, 边框/frame, 中心图案/central_pattern, 前景掩码/foreground_mask, 枢轴像素/pivot_pixel, 分隔线/separator_line, 种子图案/seed_motif, 开放单元格/open_cell, 空心矩形/hollow_rectangle, 封闭孔洞/enclosed_hole, 轮廓线/outline, 整幅网格/whole_grid, 模板区/template_region, 掩码标记/mask_marker, 分隔行/separator_row, 轮廓顶点/outline_vertex, 阴影像素/shadow_pixel, 控制像素/control_pixel, 整行整列射线/full_row_column_ray, 对角邻居/diagonal_neighbor, 掩码区域/mask_region, 单像素标记/singleton_marker, 空心矩形框/hollow_rect_frame, 对角象限/diagonal_quadrant, 矩形条/rect_bar, 线路网络/wire_network, 令牌/token, 整幅画布/full_canvas, 稀疏边框/sparse_frame, 稀疏精灵体/sparse_sprite, 前景像素/foreground_pixel, 画布边界/canvas_boundary
